WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Select the words for the prop in the screenplay.

2
00:00:09.212 --> 00:00:17.212
Open Breakdown tagging for the selected text.

3
00:00:18.418 --> 00:00:26.418
Name the element and apply it as a prop.

4
00:00:27.856 --> 00:00:35.856
Open Review Draft in Backlot from the File menu.

5
00:00:37.063 --> 00:00:45.063
Choose the open Night Ferry production project.

6
00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:54.290
Preview the captured draft and its production changes.

7
00:00:55.512 --> 00:01:03.512
Review matched scenes, cast changes, and the new element.

8
00:01:04.819 --> 00:01:12.819
Apply the reviewed import, then check the schedule in Backlot.
